Third-party dependencies
================================================================

This project depends at runtime on FastAPI, Pydantic, and Uvicorn,
installed via pip and not vendored into this repository. All three are
MIT-licensed; their transitive dependencies (starlette, click, h11,
httptools, python-dotenv, pyyaml, uvloop, watchfiles, websockets,
typing-extensions, annotated-types, pydantic-core, and related packages)
are MIT, BSD-3-Clause, or PSF-2.0. None are copyleft, none require
reproduction of their license text here, and none are vendored — see
each package's own PyPI distribution for its license.
